## Subagents and review

Before delegating, inspect tools actually exposed in this session. If `use_subagents` is available,
limit Cline subagents to bounded, read-only research or review: they do not modify files, and the
parent retains writes, decisions, and validation. Do not assume a subagent can browse, call MCPs, or
create other subagents.

Apply `multi-agent-required` from `AGENTS.md`: useful delegated read-only research or review is
real delegation without granting write access. If required native capability is unavailable, report
the blocker; no single-agent fallback without an explicit user request. Required independent review
remains a closure gate.

